WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Hands on the wall at shoulder height. Keep a straight line from head to heels as you lower and press away.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.500
When three sets of twelve feel easy, move your hands to a kitchen counter and repeat.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Progress one step lower at a time. Your coach will update your plan when you log the reps.
